# The image is built from source: dependencies come from `npm ci` in the deps stage, settings from
# docker-compose env at runtime. Without this file `COPY . .` sent ~1.4 GB (Windows node_modules,
# the dev .next cache) and baked the laptop's .env files into the image.
node_modules
.next
.git
.env*
!.env.example
duet
public/uploads
*.tar
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
